SignVox note: en_common.txt is the top of the English frequency list from
the FrequencyWords project (https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords,
MIT License, © 2016 Hermit Dave), derived from the OpenSubtitles corpus —
filtered to plain 2-12 letter words and uppercased. Used for the offline
word-suggestion bar in Spell mode.
